es with varying difficulty levels and diverse formations. \nWith three challenging difficulty settings, you can test your skills at different paces. \nAdapt and strategize using various formations, adding depth to your gameplay.\nEnjoy the thrill of the game as you dive into this VR football experience, where you're in control of every pass, shot, and goal. \n\nWhether you're a beginner or an expert, this VR game offers an exhilarating opportunity to showcase your abilities and tactical prowess in the world's most beloved sport.", "short_description": "Experience immersive football (soccer) matches in virtual reality.\n\nEngage in full matches with varying difficulty levels and diverse formations. \nWith three challenging difficulty settings, you can test your skills at different paces. \nAdapt and strategize using various formations, adding depth to your gameplay.\nEnjoy the thrill of the game as you dive into this VR football experience, where you're in control of every pass, shot, and goal. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/football_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://football.artisoft.pl/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "6976186875766449"}}]}, "s